## NexoBeam Local Configuration
# To configure your Supabase backend credentials, copy this file or configure .env:
# SUPABASE_URL=https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<your-anon-public-key>
#
# Alternatively, set SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_ANON_KEY in your .env file or
# in AI Studio Secrets panel.
